==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|law|chiefly|US|Canada}} A [[lawsuit]] brought by a single [[plaintiff]] or small group of plaintiffs as a [[representative]] of a large [[group]] of others having a [[common]] [[interest]], with everyone in the large group eligible to receive [[damages]] if the plaintiff is successful.
#: {{syn|en|class action lawsuit|class suit|representative action}}

